    a: A `Tensor`. Must be one of the following types: `bfloat16`, `half`, `float32`, `float64`.
    x: A `Tensor`. Must have the same type as `a`.
    name: A name for the operation (optional).

  Returns:
    A `Tensor`. Has the same type as `a`.
  "

