    clip_value_min: A `Tensor`. Must have the same type as `t`.
      A 0-D (scalar) `Tensor`, or a `Tensor` with the same shape
      as `t`. The minimum value to clip by.
    clip_value_max: A `Tensor`. Must have the same type as `t`.
      A 0-D (scalar) `Tensor`, or a `Tensor` with the same shape
