  If the result is midway between two representable values,
  the even representable is chosen.
  For example:

  ```
  rint(-1.5) ==> -2.0
  rint(0.5000001) ==> 1.0
  rint([-1.7, -1.5, -0.2, 0.2, 1.5, 1.7, 2.0]) ==> [-2., -2., -0., 0., 2., 2., 2.]
  ```

